title: Credits
new-page: true

Many works were referenced in the making of this game.

Red October is a fork of *Social Democracy: An Alternate History* by Autumn Chen (MIT licence, https://github.com/aucchen/social_democracy_alternate_history). The engine, the interface and the structure of the cards, advisors and elections are hers.

