@books

= Books

Rabinowitch, Alexander. *The Bolsheviks Come to Power.*

Galili, Ziva. *The Menshevik Leaders in the Russian Revolution.*

Brovkin, Vladimir. *The Mensheviks After October.*

Getzler, Israel. *Martov*, and *Kronstadt 1917-1921.*

Radkey, Oliver. *Russia Goes to the Polls*, and *The Sickle Under the Hammer.*

Smith, S. A. *Russia in Revolution.*

Liebich, Andre. *From the Other Shore.*

Ascher, Abraham. *The Mensheviks in the Russian Revolution.*

Jansen, Marc. *A Show Trial under Lenin.*

Radkey, Oliver. *The Agrarian Foes of Bolshevism*, and *The Sickle under the Hammer.*

Haimson, Leopold. Article on the December 1917 Menshevik congress, *Russian Review*, 1980.

