@links

= Web sources

Seventeen Moments in Soviet History: 1917 (soviethistory.msu.edu).

Brovkin, "The Mensheviks' Political Comeback" (1983).

Rosenberg, "Russian Labor and Bolshevik Power after October."

Results of the 1917 Russian Constituent Assembly election; the 1917 Moscow district duma elections; the Vikzhel negotiations (Wikipedia).

Deutscher, "The Mensheviks' Debacle" (marxists.org); the Martov archive (marxists.org).

*Several figures in the game are design estimates; the plan lists which.*

